# Tier 1 adaptation for the Xiaomi Redmi 5 Plus (vince), machine vince-halium.
#
# Only what cannot be derived belongs here. The codename derives from the vendor
# (ro.product.vendor.device=vince in its build.prop).
#
# The panel's physical PPI, which an internal DSI panel does not report: 401, from
# the LineageOS device README. The device tree's qcom,mdss-pan-physical-* (69 x 122 mm)
# cannot give it, the height being a 16:9 panel's; Android's density (440) is a
# different number. Not yet checked on a booted device, and nothing else here (key
# devices, pixel ratio) has been looked at on one either.
deviceinfo_display_dpi="401"
